feat(NumberTheory/ModularForms): arithmetic subgroup improvements (#43742)
Some modest additions to the theory of subgroups of `GL(2, ℝ)`, and other general linear groups:
- generalize `adjoinNeg` to arbitrary base rings & show it is functorial under suitable maps;
- show intersection of an arithmetic subgroup with `SL(2, ℝ)` is also arithmetic;
- show any two arithmetic subgroups are commensurable.
These are used in the proof of finite-dimensionality of modular forms spaces.

fix(CI): check the PR number in decls-diff against the built commit (#44505)
This PR makes `decls-diff.yml` accept a PR number only if that PR's current head is the commit the build ran on. For fork PRs the number comes from `pr_number.txt` in the `import-graph` artifact, which is produced by the PR's own build, so a fork PR could otherwise point the patcher at a different PR and replace the declarations diff in that PR's summary comment.
It also:
- makes the same-repo fallback take the PR whose head is the built commit, rather than the first PR associated with the commit;
- emits a warning, rather than a notice, when the PR can't be read to check its head;
- skips the master-run lookup, the master-side artifact download, the diff and the tooling checkout when there is no verified PR number;
- stops both checkouts from persisting the token in `.git/config`.

