feat(Data/Set/Pairwise): add Set.PairwiseDisjoint.disjoint_of_ne (#43837)
This is a trivial lemma from unfolding the definition, but the main value here is to let `grind` make this forwards-reasoning step, without needing to actually unfold PairwiseDisjoint.
For reviewers' convenience, the pattern here is
```
[ @Disjoint #11 #9 #8 _ _,           -- the conclusion  Disjoint (f i) (f j)
  @PairwiseDisjoint _ #10 _ _ #7 #6, -- the hypothesis  s.PairwiseDisjoint f
  @Membership.mem _ _ _ #7 #4,       -- i ∈ s
  @Membership.mem _ _ _ #7 #3 ]      -- j ∈ s
```

